    "zh": "供应商绩效与交付风险助手",
    "en": "Supplier Performance and Delivery Risk Assistant"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "以采购订单计划行为粒度核对净收货与日期，查看供应商OTIF、交付偏差和仍需跟进的订单。",
    "en": "Compare net receipts and dates at PO schedule-line grain to review supplier OTIF, delivery variance and open follow-up."
  },
  "status": "Three-stage live acceptance passed",
  "version": "0.2.3",
  "owner": "MM-PUR / Supplier Management",
  "tags": [
    "Supplier Performance",
    "OTIF",
    "Delivery Risk",
    "Purchase Order"
  ],
